  "guide": "Here `Limit` is $A$ and `PreCAR` is the normed direct limit before completion. `preRootFunctional` is its bounded coordinate functional, and `.extend` gives $\\omega$ on the completion. The stage inclusion $\\iota_n$ used in the Statement is named `ofStage n` in the separately linked [restriction theorem `rootState_stage`](https://github.com/r-tanaka-math/mathlib-annex/blob/437e6e46228bbb8e91211ebded349d7a30020e73/MathlibAnnex/Analysis/CStarAlgebra/CAR/Completion.lean#L478-L481), not in the defining line displayed here. Positivity and normalization are also separate cited results.",
